# Wireframe: Login

## Purpose & Flow Context

Authentication screen for unauthenticated users. Entry: visiting a protected route without valid tokens, or explicit logout. Exit: successful login redirects to dashboard (Issue List) or original target.

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Single-column centered layout. 8px cadence.

**App-shell**: No shell — full-screen standalone view. No sidebar or header.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Branding | Logo + app name + tagline | Top center |
| Login form | Email input, password input, submit button, link to register | Center, max-width 400px |
| Footer | "Powered by..." or links | Bottom, subtle |

**Content hierarchy**:
1. Branding — identity reassurance
2. Form — primary action
3. Error/success feedback — below form

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                      [Linear App Clone Logo]                      |
|                         Track your work                            |
|                                                                    |
|                   ___________________________                      |
|                   | Email                   |                     |
|                   ___________________________                      |
|                                                                    |
|                   ___________________________                      |
|                   | Password                |                     |
|                   ___________________________                      |
|                                                                    |
|                         [Log In]                                  |
|                                                                    |
|                   Don't have an account? Sign up                   |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Email input | Input | `type="email"`, required | Validation: email format |
| Password input | Input | `type="password"`, required | Show/hide toggle |
| Log In | Button (primary) | Submits credentials | Disabled during submit; shows loading |
| Sign up link | Link | Navigates to registration | — |

## Data Display

N/A — form only.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| "Track your work" | Value proposition tagline | Below logo |
| Email placeholder | "Email" | Not "Enter your email" — concise |
| Password placeholder | "Password" | — |
| "Log In" | Primary action CTA | Changes to "Logging in..." during submit |
| "Don't have an account? Sign up" | Conversion link | Visual hierarchy: secondary text, primary link |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Form with empty fields. See sketch above.

### Loading

Submit button shows spinner. Store: `isLoading=true`.

```
|                    [⟳ Logging in...]                           |
```

### Error

Authentication failed — inline error below form.

```
|  [!] Invalid email or password. Please try again.              |
```

Network error:

```
|  [!] Could not connect. Check your internet connection.  [Retry] |
```

### Success

Redirect to dashboard or original target URL. Store: `isAuthenticated=true`, tokens stored.

```
|  [⏳ Redirecting to dashboard...]                               |
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Centered card with shadow |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same layout, slightly smaller |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width form (no card); padding 16px sides |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `main` with `aria-label="Login"` |
| Heading order | h1 "Track your work" (visually hidden h1: "Log in") |
| Reading / Focus order | Logo → Email → Password → Log In → Sign up link |
| Accessible names | Email input: `<label for="email">`, Password: `<label for="password">` |
| Keyboard operability | Tab between fields, Enter to submit, Escape does nothing |
| Target size | All inputs ≥24×24 CSS px; submit button ≥24×24 CSS px |
| Focus not obscured | No sticky elements |
| Non-color intent | Error states include icon + text |

*Defer to design-system: pixel contrast, focus-appearance, per-component target-size/keyboard.*
